	(descr "EFM8BB51 QFN20 3x3 mm, pitch 0.5, corner pins 1/6/11/16, EP 1.8 mm (no footprint vias: per D107 the board places microvias in the EP, plus buried vias under the body). Land = EFM8BB51 data sheet Rev 1.0 Table 7.2 p56; paste per note 8 (2x2 x 0.75 on 0.95). https://www.silabs.com/documents/public/data-sheets/efm8bb51-datasheet.pdf | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: toe 1.61 (D 3.00 BSC, aaa 0.15 -> 1.575 max + 0.035), heel 1.10 kept (= D/2-Lnom), width 0.25 = b nom, EP/paste unchanged, the 4 through-hole EP via pads of the original removed (D107, orchestrator 18:55)")
